1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,790
Plane ki window kabhi square kyun nahi hoti?

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:05,280
1950s me kuch jet planes hawa me hi toot gaye.

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,890
Jaanch me pata chala: cracks corners ke paas the.

4
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:10,780
Plane ke andar hawa ka pressure bahar se zyada hota hai.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,310
Square window me saara zor ek kone pe aata hai.

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:15,560
Gol window me zor barabar bat jaata hai.

7
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,970
Isliye window ke kone hamesha gol hote hain.

8
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:20,860
Subscribe karo, warna agli flight me middle seat milegi!

9
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,150
Ruko! Window me chhota sa ched dekha hai?

10
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,720
Window me 3 glass hote hain, ched beech wale me.

11
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,690
Isse saara pressure bahar wale mazboot glass pe jaata hai.

12
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,980
Beech wala glass backup ban ke rehta hai.

13
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,590
Aur isi ched se nami nikalti hai, fog nahi jamta.

14
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:36,720
Toh agli baar window seat pe sirf selfie nahi, gyaan bhi lena!
